  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific 2024 Public Sector Leadership Short Course</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity seeks to deliver a Public Sector Leadership course, to cohorts of up to 30 scholars from Pacific partner countries.
This course was piloted for the Pacific via online learning in 2021 and 2022 while the New Zealand borders were closed. It has since been adapted for in-person delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
